---
alt: "Santashop public app data and function flow"
---
sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Santashop public app data and function flow
    accDescr: Main frontend services, callable functions, and Firestore records involved in the public registration journey

    actor User
    participant UI as Santashop App UI
    participant Auth as Firebase Auth
    participant Core as App/Core Services
    participant Fn as Cloud Functions
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant St as Firebase Storage
    participant Trig as Triggers / Scheduled Jobs

    User->>UI: Create account
    UI->>Fn: newAccount(onboarding fields)
    Fn->>Auth: createUser(email, password)
    Fn->>FS: create users/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: create registrations/{uid}
    Fn->>St: write registrations/{uid}.png
    UI->>Auth: signInWithEmailAndPassword
    Core->>FS: read users/{uid}
    Core->>FS: read registrations/{uid}

    User->>UI: Save referral
    UI->>Fn: updateReferredBy({ referredBy })
    Fn->>FS: update users/{uid}.referredBy

    User->>UI: Add/edit/remove child
    UI->>FS: update registrations/{uid}.children[]

    User->>UI: Choose slot pre-submit
    UI->>FS: update registrations/{uid}.dateTimeSlot
    UI->>FS: read dateTimeSlots where enabled and programYear

    User->>UI: Submit registration
    UI->>Fn: completeRegistration(registration snapshot)
    Fn->>FS: update registrations/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: upsert registrationsearchindex/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: upsert tmp_registrationemails/{uid}
    FS-->>Trig: document write fires email trigger

    User->>UI: Change slot after submit
    UI->>Fn: changeRegistrationDateTime({ newDateTimeSlot })
    Fn->>FS: update registrations/{uid}.previousDateTimeSlot
    Fn->>FS: update registrations/{uid}.dateTimeSlot
    Fn->>FS: upsert tmp_registrationemails/{uid}
    FS-->>Trig: document write fires email trigger

    User->>UI: Change profile info
    UI->>Fn: changeAccountInformation({ firstName, lastName, zipCode })
    Fn->>Auth: update displayName
    Fn->>FS: update users/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: update registrations/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: update registrationsearchindex/{uid}

    User->>UI: Change email
    UI->>Auth: re-authenticate current user
    UI->>Fn: updateEmailAddress({ emailAddress })
    Fn->>Auth: update email
    Fn->>FS: update users/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: update registrations/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: update registrationsearchindex/{uid}

    User->>UI: Change password
    UI->>Auth: re-authenticate current user
    UI->>Auth: updatePassword(newPassword)

    Admin->>Fn: checkIn or checkInWithEdit
    Fn->>FS: create checkins/{uid}
    Core->>FS: observe checkins/{uid}
    Core-->>UI: show final alert and logout
